## Introduction

Because of its intrinsic difficulty in positional evaluation and large branching factor, Go has been the most challenging board game for AI research since the dawn of computer Go 40 years ago [23], [26]. Domain knowledge has been essential in the development of computer Go [2], [9], [22].
